void help(){std::cout<<"rns8-ragged-calibrate cpu-reference|hip-direct DEVICE uniform_export|ragged_export|ragged_resident ROWS COLS mixed|fullwidth|wide140 signed|unsigned TILE_ROWS TILE_COLS REUSE REPEATS WARMUPS RUN_ID\n"
 "CPU device-1 or explicit HIP0..63; no fallback. Rows/cols1..512, tile extents1..128, reuse1..256, repeats/warmups1..1000.\n"
 "Wide140 source uses untimed public exact GEMM K16384 with rows*cols*K<=134217728; native recipes pack full64bit inputs.\n"
 "Matched host boundary: uniform export vs ragged reconstruction then identical export each reuse. Resident reconstruction has no synthetic copy baseline.\n"
 "All references/checksums/canaries outside production intervals. First-use, retained capacities, repeated preparations and sustained lifecycle timings are separate.\n"
 "Run ID1..128 ASCII alnum/_/-. Exact-wide prefix20; 512MiB logical payload cap; no HBM/overlap inference.\n";}
